  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BELARUSIAN DIASPORA INITIATIVE (BDI): EMPOWERING THE BUSINESS ECOSYSTEM IN EXILE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;BDI aims to promote the continuity and growth of the Belarusian business community in exile by offering targeted support to address the diverse challenges faced by both EU-based Belarusian BSOs and businesses that have relocated to an EU member state. By fostering the creation and strengthening of a dedicated network of BSOs, the project ensures that these businesses receive the essential support needed for the successful integration into the EU market. Additionally, the project&#xBF;s activities, focused on empowering businesses, will contribute to fostering sustainable growth and resilience, better preparing them for a successful reintegration into their homeland in the future.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
